      "feedback": "自动测试：31/35。\n用例 fill-edge-3，模式 sequence，行为不匹配，请检查 fillsToday, valveOpen。\n用例 fill-edge-4，模式 sequence，行为不匹配，请检查 fillsToday, valveOpen。\n用例 fill-edge-5，模式 sequence，行为不匹配，请检查 fillsToday, valveOpen。\n用例 fill-edge-6，模式 sequence，行为不匹配，请检查 fillsToday, valveOpen。\nLTL 检查：not_run。",
      "idx": 0,
      "code": "FUNCTION_BLOCK FB\nVAR_INPUT\n    startBtn   : BOOL;\n    resetBtn   : BOOL;\n    doneSensor : BOOL;\n    targetVol  : REAL;\n    flowVol    : REAL;\nEND_VAR\nVAR_OUTPUT\n    valveOpen  : BOOL;\n    fillsToday : INT := 0;\nEND_VAR\nVAR\n    prevStartBtn   : BOOL := FALSE;\n    prevResetBtn   : BOOL := FALSE;\n    prevValveOpen  : BOOL := FALSE;\n    prevDoneSensor : BOOL := FALSE;\n    prevFillsToday : INT  := 0;\n    \n    currentVolume  : REAL := 0.0;\n    pendingConfirm : BOOL := FALSE;\nEND_VAR\n\nVAR_TEMP\n    risingStart  : BOOL;\n    risingReset  : BOOL;\n    risingDone   : BOOL;\nEND_VAR\n\n// 检测上升沿\nrisingStart  := startBtn AND NOT prevStartBtn;\nrisingReset  := resetBtn AND NOT prevResetBtn;\nrisingDone   := doneSensor AND NOT prevDoneSensor;\n\n// ========== 1. 复位优先 ==========\nIF risingReset THEN\n    // 清零计数和累计体积\n    fillsToday      := 0;\n    currentVolume   := 0.0;\n    // 关阀并清除待确认\n    valveOpen       := FALSE;\n    pendingConfirm  := FALSE;\nELSE\n    // ========== 2. 启动新瓶 ==========\n    IF risingStart THEN\n        // 若上一瓶仍待确认，先取消\n        pendingConfirm := FALSE;\n        // 清零本瓶累计并开阀\n        currentVolume  := 0.0;\n        valveOpen      := TRUE;\n    END_IF;\n    \n    // ========== 3. 灌装累计与关阀 ==========\n    IF valveOpen THEN\n        // 加入本拍流量，启动拍也计入\n        currentVolume := currentVolume + flowVol;\n        \n        // 累计达到或超过目标时立即关阀并令本瓶待确认\n        IF currentVolume >= targetVol THEN\n            valveOpen      := FALSE;\n            pendingConfirm := TRUE;\n        END_IF;\n    END_IF;\n    \n    // ========== 4. 确认逻辑 ==========\n    IF pendingConfirm THEN\n        // 本拍关阀后立即读取 doneSensor\n        IF doneSensor THEN\n            // 本拍确认并计数\n            pendingConfirm := FALSE;\n            \n            // fillsToday 增加 1；原计数为 32767 时保持 32767\n            IF fillsToday < 32767 THEN\n                fillsToday := fillsToday + 1;\n            END_IF;\n        END_IF;\n    END_IF;\nEND_IF;\n\n// 更新上电前值（用于下一拍上升沿检测）\nprevStartBtn   := startBtn;\nprevResetBtn   := resetBtn;\nprevValveOpen  := valveOpen;\nprevDoneSensor := doneSensor;\nprevFillsToday := fillsToday;\nEND_FUNCTION_BLOCK",
