      "feedback": "自动测试：21/35。\n用例 b6，模式 sequence，行为不匹配，请检查 fillsToday, valveOpen。\n用例 b7，模式 sequence，行为不匹配，请检查 fillsToday。\n用例 b8，模式 sequence，行为不匹配，请检查 fillsToday。\n用例 fill-abandon-2，模式 sequence，行为不匹配，请检查 fillsToday, valveOpen。\n用例 fill-edge-3，模式 sequence，行为不匹配，请检查 fillsToday, valveOpen。\n用例 fill-edge-4，模式 sequence，行为不匹配，请检查 fillsToday, valveOpen。\nLTL 检查：not_run。",
      "idx": 1,
      "code": "FUNCTION_BLOCK FB\nVAR_INPUT\n    startBtn   : BOOL;\n    resetBtn   : BOOL;\n    doneSensor : BOOL;\n    targetVol  : REAL;\n    flowVol    : REAL;\nEND_VAR\nVAR_OUTPUT\n    valveOpen  : BOOL;\n    fillsToday : INT := 0;\nEND_VAR\nVAR\n    prevStartBtn   : BOOL := FALSE;\n    prevResetBtn   : BOOL := FALSE;\n    prevValveOpen  : BOOL := FALSE;\n    \n    currentVolume  : REAL := 0.0;\n    pendingConfirm : BOOL := FALSE;\nEND_VAR\n\nVAR_TEMP\n    risingStart : BOOL;\n    risingReset : BOOL;\nEND_VAR\n\nrisingStart := startBtn AND NOT prevStartBtn;\nrisingReset := resetBtn AND NOT prevResetBtn;\n\n// ========== 1. 复位优先 ==========\nIF risingReset THEN\n    fillsToday      := 0;\n    currentVolume   := 0.0;\n    valveOpen       := FALSE;\n    pendingConfirm  := FALSE;\n    prevStartBtn    := resetBtn;\n    prevResetBtn    := resetBtn;\n    RETURN;\nEND_IF;\n\n// ========== 2. 启动新瓶 ==========\nIF risingStart THEN\n    pendingConfirm := FALSE;\n    currentVolume  := 0.0;\n    \n    IF flowVol >= targetVol THEN\n        // 启动拍直接达标：关阀，本拍确认\n        valveOpen      := FALSE;\n        pendingConfirm := TRUE;\n    ELSE\n        valveOpen := TRUE;\n    END_IF;\nELSE\n    // ========== 3. 灌装累计 ==========\n    IF valveOpen THEN\n        currentVolume := currentVolume + flowVol;\n        \n        IF currentVolume >= targetVol THEN\n            valveOpen      := FALSE;\n            pendingConfirm := TRUE;\n        END_IF;\n    END_IF;\nEND_IF;\n\n// ========== 4. 确认逻辑 ==========\nIF pendingConfirm AND doneSensor THEN\n    pendingConfirm := FALSE;\n    IF fillsToday < 32767 THEN\n        fillsToday := fillsToday + 1;\n    END_IF;\nEND_IF;\n\nprevStartBtn  := startBtn;\nprevResetBtn  := resetBtn;\nprevValveOpen := valveOpen;\nEND_FUNCTION_BLOCK",
